      {
        "detail": 0,
        "format": 0,
        "mode": "normal",
        "style": "",
        "text": "Front Range Passenger Rail Ballot Issue 7A is Colorado’s best opportunity to establish true passenger rail extending along the north/south corridor. While there’s a lot to say about what’s on the 2026 ballot, Issue 7A, establishing the CoCo train is something that gets me truly excited about the future of Colorado.",
