      {
        "detail": 0,
        "format": 0,
        "mode": "normal",
        "style": "",
        "text": "From an election perspective, state legislators made a smart choice to update the district boundaries before putting a measure to voters: “Under ",
        "type": "extended-text",
        "version": 1
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "detail": 0,
            "format": 8,
            "mode": "normal",
            "style": "",
            "text": "SB26-172",
            "type": "extended-text",
            "version": 1
          }
        ],
        "direction": "ltr",
        "format": "",
        "indent": 0,
        "type": "link",
        "version": 1,
        "rel": null,
        "target": null,
        "title": null,
        "url": "https://leg.colorado.gov/bills/SB26-172"
      },
      {
        "detail": 0,
        "format": 0,
        "mode": "normal",
        "style": "",
        "text": ", the district would be redrawn to a fraction of its current geographic size and shed about 40% of its population, shrinking to 2.6 million residents from 4.4 million,” ",
        "type": "extended-text",
        "version": 1
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "detail": 0,
            "format": 8,
            "mode": "normal",
            "style": "",
            "text": "per Colorado Newsline",
            "type": "extended-text",
            "version": 1
          }
        ],
        "direction": "ltr",
        "format": "",
        "indent": 0,
        "type": "link",
        "version": 1,
        "rel": null,
        "target": null,
        "title": null,
        "url": "https://coloradonewsline.com/2026/04/28/boundaries-rail-district-would-shrink/"
      },
      {
        "detail": 0,
        "format": 0,
        "mode": "normal",
        "style": "",
        "text": ". The decision better aligns people paying the tax with people getting the most usage of the service, increasing the likelihood that the measure passes.",
        "type": "extended-text",
        "version": 1
      }
    ],
    "direction": "ltr",
    "format": "",
    "indent": 0,
    "type": "paragraph",
    "version": 1
  },
  {
    "type": "image",
    "version": 1,
    "src": "https://bouldercoloradovoterguide.com/content/images/2026/10/data-src-image-113866d9-297b-4aee-9d90-352da31c57a6.png",
